{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The naval war rages on in Dualbooted\u2019s sequel to the classic battleship game!</strong> Step back onto the deck and face new challenges while keeping the gameplay you know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the familiar <strong>Classic Mode</strong>, or test yourself in two new modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Defence</strong> \u2013 guard an allied vessel for as long as you can against endless enemy attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mayday</strong> \u2013 protect a damaged ship as it struggles to repair itself. If it\u2019s restored, move on to save another, and another, until you\u2019re overwhelmed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, upgrade your ship with new parts or purchase entirely new vessels to match your style. Face shifting weather conditions that change the fight and force you to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea is unforgiving. <strong>How long can you last?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3989000?t=1758206845","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3989000?t=1758206845","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989000/00fc686a3c280b97683b2f0e89890bd4abdb11bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758206845","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989000/00fc686a3c280b97683b2f0e89890bd4abdb11bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758206845","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The naval war rages on in Dualbooted\u2019s sequel to the classic battleship game!</strong> Step back onto the deck and face new challenges while keeping the gameplay you know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the familiar <strong>Classic Mode</strong>, or test yourself in two new modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Defence</strong> \u2013 guard an allied vessel for as long as you can against endless enemy attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mayday</strong> \u2013 protect a damaged ship as it struggles to repair itself. If it\u2019s restored, move on to save another, and another, until you\u2019re overwhelmed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, upgrade your ship with new parts or purchase entirely new vessels to match your style. Face shifting weather conditions that change the fight and force you to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea is unforgiving. <strong>How long can you last?</strong></p>","developers":["Priyam Jain","Matthew Lalande"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989000/544b7f8e772cb9c07bd28b00cbda56e94ddce0bd/header.jpg?t=1758206845","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 14 Sonoma<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-11400H @ 2.70GHz 2.69 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 64.6 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257195267,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195267/movie480.mp4?t=1758206843","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195267/movie_max.mp4?t=1758206843"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257195267/012b9864dc5417be961a1a7ed1a871ed9177121f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758206843","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_